     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Zoe,<div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\">測試 Windows 10 + R-3.3.2-32bit 結果是正常, 可能原因之一是 Excel 檔案(xls) 格式設定問題,  參考附件與以下執行畫面:</span></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: import Excel with RODBC</div><div># date: 2016.12.15</div><div><br></div><div>library(RODBC)</div><div>data &lt;- odbcConnectExcel(&#39;C:/rdata/rodbc_test.xls&#39;)</div><div>mydata &lt;- sqlFetch(data, &#39;rodbc_test&#39;)</div><div>odbcClose(data)</div><div>mydata</div><div>str(mydata)</div><div>View(mydata)</div><div><br></div><div>x &lt;- c(&#39;2016/9/23 07:00:00&#39;, &#39;2016/9/23 07:00:00&#39;, &#39;2016/9/24 07:00:00&#39;)</div><div>x</div><div>as.POSIXct(x)</div><div>as.Date(x)</div></font></div></code></div><br><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-MffLIsE-3TA/WFJ9cF1sUmI/AAAAAAAAK9o/srll-KxKZFsmovWf34soBh-F2AVYV3ZbgCLcB/s1600/r-rodbc_excel.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-MffLIsE-3TA/WFJ9cF1sUmI/AAAAAAAAK9o/srll-KxKZFsmovWf34soBh-F2AVYV3ZbgCLcB/s1600/r-rodbc_excel.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237816316000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FCouiOqVJyWy6ulYetTCM\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-MffLIsE-3TA/WFJ9cF1sUmI/AAAAAAAAK9o/srll-KxKZFsmovWf34soBh-F2AVYV3ZbgCLcB/s400/r-rodbc_excel.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"252\"></a></p><div># end</div><div><br>Zoe Cheng於 2016年12月15日星期四 UTC+8下午12時25分22秒寫道：</div></div></div>"
